  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you can take on a more bestial form for 1 minute, or until you return to your normal form as a Bonus Action. When you do, you gain Temporary Hit Points equal to twice your Proficiency Bonus. You can enter this form a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest. In your bestial form, you gain the following benefits:</p><p><strong>Increased Speed.</strong> Your Speed increases by 10 feet.</p><p><strong>Reactive Movement.</strong> You can take a Reaction to move up to 10 feet when a creature ends its turn within 5 feet of you. This movement doesn't provoke Opportunity Attacks.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
